      "allAltTextYaml": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "filename": "Outer_Front",
            "alt": "Comic cover. Muscular woman walks into dark woods from behind. Title: Fighting: A comic by Petrichor Lin",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Inner_Front",
            "alt": "Content Warning: Domestic Violence",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_1",
            "alt": "Narration: When I was a kid, I wanted to learn how to fight.\n1. Opening shot of a suburban house at night.\n2. Shot of an empty dining room.\n3. A little girl with blonde hair hides in an enclosed space, looking worried.\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_2",
            "alt": "1. Little girl peaks out of cabinet door.\n2. Mom and Dad are fighting by holding up chairs. Mom looks angry, and dad looks worried.\n3. Dad holds his chair as a shield to defend against a hit from another chair.\n4. Another chair hit towards Dad, but this time, the chair Dad is holding is knocked out of his hands.\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_3",
            "alt": "1. Closeup. Mom's eyes are angry.\n2. Closeup. Dad's eyes are angry.\n3. Mom holds a chair over head, aiming at Dad who is on the ground. Mom: \"I'm gonna kill you!\"\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_4",
            "alt": "1. Dad is in the hospital with a bruised face.\n2. Black panel. Narration: \"Dad was a kind man.\"\n3. Wide panel. Dad and the little girl look over a peaceful landscape.\n4. Dad picks out a flower for his daughter.\n5. Flashback to Mom kicking Dad in the face. Dad: \"Please just stop.\"\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_5",
            "alt": "Narration: \"She never stopped.\"\n1. Wide panel. Mom and daughter are at a funeral.\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_6",
            "alt": "Narration: \"I have never been in a fight.\"\nA full bleed page showing a montage of the little girl growing up and landing stronger and stronger punches at a punching bag. By the end of the page, she is an adult boxer.\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_7",
            "alt": "1. Our narrator is in a boxing ring, getting punched in the face by another woman. Narration: \"At least not a real one.\"\n2. She punches her opponent in the face back.\n3. She wins the match, with a referee holding her hand up. Bright spotlights shine in the background.\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_8",
            "alt": "Full bleed page with black and white art. Our narrator is shown walking through a park with a sad face. Narration: \"Somehow it feels wrong...\"",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_9",
            "alt": "1. Narrator is sitting on a grassy hill, looking at a calm sky. Narration: \"...That the world is gentle.\"\n2. Closeup of the narrator picking a flower.\n3. Narrator stares at a daisy. Narration: \"Even knowing that's no need...\"\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_10-11",
            "alt": "2-page spread of the narrator throwing a hard punch at a punching bag with a stoic face. Narration: \"I can't stop fighting.\"",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_12-Inner_Back",
            "alt": "2-page black and white spread. Narrator looks over a calm ocean as birds fly into the distance.",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Outer_Back",
            "alt": "Back cover. A single daisy in an empty ink bottle is shown. Text: @ImFineComics",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "1-fighting"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Outer_Front",
            "alt": "Comic cover. A girl with short hair reaches toward a glowing full moon. Another girl with long wavy hair sits on the moon's edge. Title on the moon: 600 million steps. Credit: by petrichor lin",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "2-600-million-steps"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_1",
            "alt": "A girl with long wavy hair (Moon girl) stands barefoot on the surface of the moon, looking out at Earth.\nEarth girl (off-panel): \"I know you prefer the moon.\"\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "2-600-million-steps"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_2",
            "alt": "The same girl sits alone inside a crater, knees drawn up, looking down.\nEarth girl (off-panel): \"But it's lonely there, isn't it?\"\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "2-600-million-steps"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_3",
            "alt": "The girl with short hair (Earth girl) stares at the moon from Earth.",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "2-600-million-steps"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_4",
            "alt": "Earth girl goes through underwater astronaut training.",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "2-600-million-steps"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_5",
            "alt": "She's in the crowded cockpit of a spaceship, looking out a small window to see the moon.\nEarth girl: \"I may never understand your world.\"\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "2-600-million-steps"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Page_6",
            "alt": "The Earth girl approaches the Moon girl and offers a hand. The Moon girl looks up at her and smiles.\nEarth girl: \"But I want to try.\"\n",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "2-600-million-steps"
            }
          },
          {
            "filename": "Outer_Back",
            "alt": "Back cover. The two girls sit together atop a small moon against a starry sky. Text: SlantOfRain.com",
            "parent": {
              "relativeDirectory": "2-600-million-steps"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
